CORE
main.cpp

^\[main\.assertion\.1\] .* qualified call through private base: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] .* WRONG \(must FAIL\): FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
Guards the point-of-use access judgment of qualified calls.  g++ 13 and
clang++ 18 accept this program, and it fails only its WRONG assertion.
